config COMPONENTS_NMSIS_NN_ENABLE
    bool "Enable NMSIS-NN (Nuclei RISC-V NN kernels)"
    default n
    help
      Enable NMSIS-NN, the Nuclei neural network kernel library for RISC-V.
      Provides int8/int4/int16 convolution, depthwise convolution, pooling,
      fully-connected, softmax and LSTM kernels.

      DSP (P-extension) acceleration is enabled automatically when the app is
      built with an xxldsp march - no extra option is required.

      This is the int8 world used by TFLM. It is independent of the uint8
      kernels in components/ai that serve the .inm NPU path; the two can
      coexist. License: Apache 2.0.
